<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3316" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ā^rabs</span></b> , ăbis,
			adj. (acc. Gr. Arabas, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 10,
		478</span></i>), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄραψ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>proceeding from
			Arabia</i>, <i>Arabian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pastor Arabs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					4, 12, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">messor Arabs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 65, 5</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>, <i>an Arab</i>, <i>Arabian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Eoi Arabes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					3, 2, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Eoae domus Arabum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 115</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2 Par. 17, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">ib. Act. 2,
				11</span></i>.—<b>Meton.</b>, for <i>Arabia</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmiferos Arabas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 478</span></i>
			.</div>
